<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TENNIS-SOUTH AFRICA LEAD RUSSIA 1-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SOUTH AFRICA LEAD RUSSIA 1-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa led Russia 1-0 after</p>
<p>winning the opening singles in their Davis Cup World Group first</p>
<p>round tie on Friday.</p>
<p>Result (South African name first):</p>
<p>Marcos Ondruska beat Andrei Chesnokov 7-6 (7-2) 6-3 3-6 4-6 7-5</p>
</text>
